doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779702","source_hash":"cb8c6b238f800814355e19339cd8accac66e3694f0770d65b3b95a72a190e49c","text":"备注"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00014","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779703","source_hash":"607f7070b1b15e4e7ebb6757ed3a03f2f7391c4fa7d156a053f989a4658b284b","text":"1.“图书资料”是指图书馆资料中符合下列各款规定的资料。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00015","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779704","source_hash":"4308f593a82f8692c052cd0155bdd2009543c45b256497eb916a6245dcc72823","text":"a. 印刷材料（不包括序列号）"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00016","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779705","source_hash":"41c39bf6aafa1cfb6667c7545a6e7cd26ed5a5ed02b9a8d9b0f953fe753acf2a","text":"B. 手稿（不包括期刊）"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00017","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779706","source_hash":"2db276b0da87a42b3616b3ebfe0c9586c0e13ca16b745196fa61464c1fbdbb6d","text":"。在电子材料中，电子书"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00018","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779707","source_hash":"0d27e799c0ee843de7d24b2f280e2a2178b27cedefc7e6a6686b07b5aaf222bb","text":"2.“基础图书数量”是指相关大学图书馆登记在册的图书资料总数。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00019","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779708","source_hash":"4c5e00ebdb32d309dd5e51349ef55cd92f659c318a4224a261bd764e903408f8","text":"3.“图书数量的年度增长”是指相关年份新登记的图书资料（由相关大学购买）。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00020","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779709","source_hash":"0de2d71f80bf84d81e0fe2e695cdad3fce2bdcac6e594939db722d559a8c399a","text":"指的是数量（仅限书籍资料）。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00021","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779710","source_hash":"ce18e59014e01fb042517648e33fa38f8cb5742f38eb22b791dfb2327100390d","text":"4. “初级学院”一词是指高等教育法第2条第4款所指的学校。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00022","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779711","source_hash":"d817c6b0a3f68b074217bb53e8d0a2ef4cdf4075c1fb5b2a582b58bfad699005","text":"5. 除图书以外的图书馆资料的收藏标准应考虑学生人数、图书馆设施等因素确定。"},{"id":"A38009-zh-00023","doc":"A38009","law_id":"kr-012359-269667-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2779712","source_hash":"d62fa7f17a7177c21eb168ade9ee3fc41f9e9667b31f86da5f050f90183c2dc9","text":"确定范围应在不干扰学生和教师教学的前提下进行。"}]}